BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: High Park Yoga
UID:event_315484029@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260724T033216Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260726T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260726T180000
SUMMARY:🌿 Kirtan & High Park Yoga 🎶
DESCRIPTION:High Park Yoga\nJoin us for a beautiful summer afternoon in Hi
 gh Park as two heart-centered communities come together for movement\, mus
 ic\, breath\, and connection.\nWe'll begin with a gentle hour of yoga and 
 breathwork led by [Nici](https://www.breathinginnature.com/)\, helping you
  arrive in your body\, deepen your breath\, and prepare your voice for cha
 nting.\n\nFrom there we'll settle into a two-hour **Kirtan** with[ ](https
 ://www.hearts-calling.com/)**[Hearts Calling (Dana & Rishi)](https://www.h
 earts-calling.com/)**[.](https://www.hearts-calling.com/)\nIf you've never
  experienced Kirtan before\, you're in for something special. Kirtan is a 
 joyful\, meditative practice of call-and-response chanting that invites ev
 eryone to participate—no musical experience or singing ability required.
  You can sing\, listen\, clap\, sway\, dance or simply soak in the experie
 nce.\n\nDana and Rishi blend traditional Kirtan\, Medicine Music\, heart-i
 nspired poetry\, and uplifting chants to create gatherings that are both d
 eeply grounding and beautifully energizing. Having shared their music acro
 ss Canada\, Europe\, and India\, their intention is simple: to bring peopl
 e together through love\, presence\, and authentic expression.\n\nWe'll cl
 ose our afternoon with relaxation\, allowing the sounds and stillness to s
 ettle.\nWhether you come for the yoga\, the music\, the community\, or sim
 ply to spend an afternoon in nature\, everyone is warmly welcome.\n\n**Thi
 s offering is by donation.** Give what feels right and within your means. 
 Your contributions help support community gatherings like these and make t
 hem accessible to everyone.\n\n### What to bring\n\n• Yoga mat or blanke
 t\n• Water\n• Comfortable clothing for movement and sitting outdoors\n
 • A foldable camping chair if you'd prefer not to sit on your yoga mat d
 uring the Kirtan\n• An open heart 💚\n\n**No experience with yoga or K
 irtan is necessary. This is a rain or shine event\, we will have shelter i
 f we need.**\nCome as you are.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/high-park-yoga/events/315484029/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260630T134110Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260630T134110Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: High Park Yoga
UID:event_314241593@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260724T033216Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260730T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260730T200000
SUMMARY:High Park Yoga
DESCRIPTION:High Park Yoga\n**\\~Please [SIGN UP here](https://calendly.co
 m/breathinginnature/yoga-in-nature) for free before the class\\~**\n[Click
  here for a map of the exact location](https://goo.gl/maps/x1YMV41Bmhcf7ch
 b6).\n\nMy community classes in High Park are by donation\, for all bodies
 \, and no experience is required. What is yoga? We combine breath\, moveme
 nt and awareness\, all in the healing nature of High Park.\n\n**What to br
 ing?**\n\n* Yoga mat (optional - the grass is nice to yoga on)\n* Water\n*
  Weather-appropriate clothing/ blanket for relaxation\n\nWe yoga rain or s
 hine. There is shelter if we need it.\n\n[Exact location](https://maps.app
 .goo.gl/9424Zn5G1Xf4kTEj7)\, close the the High Park Forest School by the 
 North Gate (short walk from High Park Subway station\, Bloor and High Park
  intersection).\n\nMy classes are by donation\, or pay what you can. It's 
 also drop-in\, so feel free to just show up. Donations can be made at the 
 class in person\, via our [Breathing in Nature Gift Economy](https://www.b
 reathinginnature.com/gift-economy/) or e-transfer to nici@breathinginnatur
 e.com. On average folks donate between $5-$30 per class.\n\nPlease don't h
 esitate to contact me if you have any questions. 416.885.0583\n\nIf you ar
 e wondering who I am and what I do\, feel free to check out my my [website
 ](https://www.breathinginnature.com/)\, [Instagram](https://www.instagram.
 com/breathinginnature/)\, [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/nicole.bohr)
  page\, [my bio](https://www.breathinginnature.com/about/)\, or [my Linked
 In](www.linkedin.com/in/nicoleczerwinski/).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/high-park-yoga/events/314241593/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260412T083947Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260412T083947Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
